Package: kmod-wireguard
Version: 6.18.15-r1
Depends: kernel (=6.18.15~e02f3ca8c9255ec8f99a3136b15a8e3f-r1), kmod-crypto-lib-chacha20poly1305, kmod-crypto-lib-curve25519, kmod-udptunnel4, kmod-udptunnel6
